    "t": "0.28.2",
    "d": "2026-10-14",
    "n": "# Postgres Language Server\nA collection of language tools and a Language Server Protocol (LSP) implementation for Postgres, focusing on developer experience and reliable SQL tooling.\n- *(pretty-print)* Keep negative constants and FROM casts valid with castStyle=operator (#848) by @RaphaelFakhri in [#848](https://github.com/supabase-community/postgres-language-server/pull/848)\n- *(format)* Stop rewriting SQL and only break lines that do not fit (#849) by @psteinroe in [#849](https://github.com/supabase-commu"
   },
   {
    "t": "0.28.1",
    "d": "2026-10-10",
    "n": "# Postgres Language Server\nA collection of language tools and a Language Server Protocol (LSP) implementation for Postgres, focusing on developer experience and reliable SQL tooling.\n- *(pretty-print)* Preserve comments around boolean conditions (#845) by @edjubert in [#845](https://github.com/supabase-community/postgres-language-server/pull/845)\n- *(pretty-print)* Separate ALTER FUNCTION actions with spaces (#846) by @psteinroe in [#846](https://github.com/supabase-community/postgres-language-server/pull/8"
   },
   {
    "t": "0.28.0",
    "d": "2026-10-09",
